{\pard\qc\sa240\fs32\b Deus ex Machina? A Theological Framework for Imago Dei and Moral Agency in the Age of Generative Artificial Intelligence\par}
{\pard\qc\sa120\fs23 \b Mabrig Korie\par}
{\pard\qc\sa120\fs18 Independent Researcher, Policy Analyst & Transformational Leader \emdash  Mabrig Korie Ministries | MABRIG Digital Media, Port Harcourt, Rivers State, Nigeria\par}
{\pard\qc\sa120\fs18 contact@mabrigkorie.org | mabrigkorie.org\par}
{\pard\qc\sa120\fs19 Mabrig Journal of Interdisciplinary Research (MJIR), Vol. 2, Issue 1, 2026, pp. 229\endash 258\par}
{\pard\qc\sa120\fs19 DOI: 10.5678/mjir.v2i1.011\par}
